# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# rounded.part -- A block with a boss, every outward edge rounded
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# The rounds of the corners of the block are spheres, and those of the
# circles of the boss are tori, for the ray tests of interfere.
profile r along z 0 0 0 20 0 0 20 10 0 0 10 0
extrude blk from 0 to 5 r
circle c 6 10 5 along z
extrude boss from 5 to 8 c
union u blk boss
round 1 convex
